# Copy to .env.local and fill in. .env.local is gitignored; this file is not,
# so never put a real key here.
#
# Get a free webKey:
#   1. https://mobile.fmcsa.dot.gov/QCDevsite/ -> "API Access"
#   2. Sign in with Login.gov (a free account, no FMCSA registration needed)
#   3. "My WebKeys" -> "Get a new WebKey"
#
# The key is sent to FMCSA as a query parameter, so it is only ever used in
# server-side code. It is deliberately not prefixed NEXT_PUBLIC_ — that prefix
# is what makes Next inline a variable into the browser bundle.
FMCSA_WEB_KEY=
